## Backend
- `python app.py` runs Flask API on port 5000
- Requires ElevenLabs API key in `ELEVENLABS_API_KEY`
- as well as running
sudo apt update
sudo apt install -y python3-venv python3-pip
if using ubuntu to establish virtual environment

## Frontend
- `python3 -m http.server 5500` runs frontend on localhost:5500

## Prompts
- `prompts/news.txt`, `prompts/weather.txt`, `prompts/crime.txt`, `prompts/music.txt`
